Article 7 (Functions for Detecting and Preventing Duplicate or Fraudulent Receipt of Subsidies) The Minister of the Interior and Safety may implement the following functions in the Integrated Local Subsidy Management System to prevent duplicate or fraudulent receipt of local subsidies:
1. Functions for detecting anomalous transactions and identifying risk indicators;
2. Functions for extracting suspected cases through data analysis;
3. Functions for cross-verification through linkage of information among relevant institutions;
4. Functions for providing information to support on-site inspections;
5. Other technical functions necessary to prevent duplicate or fraudulent receipt of subsidies.
